{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 15 minutes of pure neon chaos in this fast-paced top-down shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774260/extras/801fcb19f8b91ad1d3be876402c4100d.poster.avif?t=1772969617\" aria-label=\"Gameplay gif with spaceship shooting at asteroid\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774260/extras/801fcb19f8b91ad1d3be876402c4100d.webm?t=1772969617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774260/extras/801fcb19f8b91ad1d3be876402c4100d.mp4?t=1772969617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast geometric enemy swarms, complete ridiculous space-station quests, and upgrade your ship with absurd weapons like plasma rockets, splitter beams, and ricocheting crystal shards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing inspiration from classic arcade shooters, survivor-style arena games, and a splash of retro sci-fi cartoons, <strong>Stardust Escape</strong> combines intense action with quirky charm and a healthy disrespect for seriousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774260/extras/8e74d1b22b5e612ac2b195d9b4759d5a.avif?t=1772969617\" width=600 height=91 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival runs filled with escalating chaos, in 4 different difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, twin-stick shooting with smooth movement and crunchy impacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild weapons like twin laser beams, plasma splats, and shrapnel-exploding crystals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goofy quest system featuring missing coffee machines, unstable science, and space diners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gold to level up and unlock new upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant neon visuals with a hand-drawn Jetsons-style aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endlessly replayable with different builds, weapon combos, and enemy waves</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills against the leaderboard, one for each difficulty setting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774260/extras/b6a18aaa3d6a90c5a2be0534a3249652.avif?t=1772969617\" width=600 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3774260?t=1772969617","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774260/7e13a7510238013c5575d7a90e5417992ad05a97/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772969617","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774260/7d9c5f160d54534db29ef4ff16f47edc9859717e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772969617","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774260/7d9c5f160d54534db29ef4ff16f47edc9859717e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772969617","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3823780,"description":""}],"detailed_descri